OL,3,ATwenty women had breasts removed
OL,4,Aneedlessly, says NHS trust
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Russell, who has recently taken
OL,7,Fover as CDDFT's chief executive, says
OL,8,Fhe apologises "unreservedly" for the
OL,9,Fharm the trust caused.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
