OL,3,AUS to allow Iran delegation to attend
OL,4,AUN meetings in New York as war passes
OL,5,Ahalf-year mark
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesman for the US State Department
OL,8,Fconfirmed the decision on Thursday,
OL,9,Fsaying that the delegation will be
OL,10,Fplaced under travel restrictions and
OL,11,Fwill be banned from purchasing certain
OL,12,FAmerican products.
OL,14,FThe move comes as the war shows no sign
OL,15,Fof ending. Since it began in February,
OL,16,Fit has driven up global energy prices,
OL,17,Fand expanded into neighbouring
OL,18,Fcountries.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
